  "notes": "{試|こころ}みる means to try or attempt something, typically in a deliberate, formal context.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ for direct object: ⟦{新|あたら}しい→新しい：00506_atarashii⟧⟦{方法|ほうほう}→方法：03621_houhou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{試|こころ}みる\n\nCOMPARISON OF 'TO TRY' VERBS:\n- {試|こころ}みる: to attempt (formal, deliberate, serious)\n- ⟦{試|ため}す→試す：02130_tamesu⟧: to test, try out (to see results)\n- ⟦やってみる→やってみる：noentry⟧: to try doing (casual, experiential)\n- ⟦{挑戦|ちょうせん}する→挑戦：03495_chousen⟧: to challenge, take on\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{説得|せっとく}→説得：14219_settoku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{試|こころ}みる: to attempt persuasion\n- ⟦{脱出|だっしゅつ}→脱出：13934_dasshutsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{試|こころ}みる: to attempt escape\n- ⟦{交渉|こうしょう}→交渉：02727_koushou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{試|こころ}みる: to attempt negotiation\n- ⟦{実験|じっけん}→実験：03273_jikken⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{試|こころ}みる: to attempt an experiment\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{試|こころ}み→試み：14221_kokoromi⟧: attempt, trial, experiment (noun)\n- ⟦{試行錯誤|しこうさくご}→試行錯誤：05656_shikousakugo⟧: trial and error",
